            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "Sorak",
            "text": "Sir Mir, what are you doing in our remote village ?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 57266
            },
            "characterindex": 3,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "Elder Farron",
            "text": "As a matter of fact, he is here to investigate the ruins.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 57092
            },
            "characterindex": -1,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.699999988079071
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "Mir",
            "text": "Indeed. I am looking for an artifact hidden deep into the underground complex. ",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 57272
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "Zack",
            "text": "What kind of artifact ? I know my way around machines. If it's broken I might be able to fix it.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 57260
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "Mir",
            "text": "Really ? Then why don't you and your friends fetch it for me ?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 57272
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "Zack",
            "text": "Say what ?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 57260
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "Sorak",
            "text": "Sir Mir, are you sure about him ? He is not our brightest student. I don't even think he qualifies as a student, seeing how he ditches every training sessions.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 57266
            },
            "characterindex": 3,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "Zack",
            "text": "You weren't saying that when I fixed the lights and the water tank.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 57260
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "Sorak",
            "text": "Then be a craftsman, not a hunter or a soldier !",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 57266
            },
            "characterindex": 3,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "Mir",
            "text": "I have an idea. Sorak, Lyv, why don't you accompany them ? Who knows, they might need your guidance.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 57272
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "Zack",
            "text": "Hold on, I don't want any part in this. If you're so strong without any Blades, then it must mean you're a beast with one. You don't need us at all.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 57260
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "Mir",
            "text": "True, but I'm weary.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 57272
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "Zack",
            "text": "Then do it tomorrow. I don't want to go on a school trip with him. Are all master hunters suck lazy fu- ",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 57260
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "Sorak",
            "text": "Talk with respect !",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 57266
            },
            "characterindex": 3,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "Mir",
            "text": "You're a stubborn one, aren't you ? Fine then how about this : if you go, you'll be in charge. Sorak, Lyv, you'll have to listen to him.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 57272
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "Sorak",
            "text": "You want us to have him lead us into battle ? But he doesn't have any experience ?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 57266
            },
            "characterindex": 3,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "Mir",
            "text": "Sorak, how many Blades types can you wield ? 1, maybe 2 ? This kid can use 7, and without any real training.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 57272
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "Sorak",
            "text": "So what ? Untrained potential is just a waste.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "Portrait": {
                "instanceID": 57266
            },
            "characterindex": 3,
            "ImageToShow": {
                "instanceID": 0
            },
            "musictoplay": 0,
            "voicepitch": 0.0
        },
        {
            "Charactername": "Zack",
            "text": "You know what ? You're on ! So just shut you trap, Sorak ! Let's go, everyone !",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
